---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Free Outdoor Lighting Consultation — Hays County, TX"
description: "Book a free, no-pressure outdoor lighting consultation with Excel Outdoor Lighting Co. In-home visit within 24–48 hours and a detailed estimate. Serving Buda & Hays County."
---
{% import "partials/icons.njk" as ico %}

<section class="hero hero--page">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero__inner">
      <p class="hero__tagline">No pressure. No call center.</p>
      <h1>Book your free lighting consultation</h1>
      <p class="hero__sub">Tell us about your property and we'll set up a free in-home visit — a real design and a clear written estimate before you commit to anything.</p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/contact/">Get My Free Consultation</a>
        <a class="btn btn--white btn--lg" href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}">{{ ico.svg("phone") }} {{ site.phone }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<nav class="wrap crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Free Consultation</nav>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">What to expect</p>
      <h2>How the consultation works</h2>
      <ul class="checks">
        <li>{{ ico.svg("check") }} <span><strong>We come to you</strong> — usually within 24–48 hours. We walk the property and look at what's worth lighting after dark.</span></li>
        <li>{{ ico.svg("check") }} <span><strong>You get a real design.</strong> We plan a system around your home or business, not a package off a truck.</span></li>
        <li>{{ ico.svg("check") }} <span><strong>You get a clear written estimate</strong>, typically within 24–72 hours. No surprises, no obligation.</span></li>
        <li>{{ ico.svg("check") }} <span><strong>It's genuinely free.</strong> If we're not the right fit, we'll say so.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:14px">Serving Buda, Kyle, San Marcos, Dripping Springs, Wimberley and all of Hays County — from a family-owned team that's fully insured and bonded.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="brandbar" style="background:var(--color-accent);height:4px;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:16px"></div>
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Two easy ways to start</h3>
        <p class="muted">Call or text us, or send a few details and we'll reach out to schedule.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--block" href="/contact/" style="width:100%;margin-bottom:12px">Request My Consultation</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--block" href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}" style="width:100%">{{ ico.svg("phone") }} {{ site.phone }}</a>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:16px;font-size:.9rem">Mon–Fri 8am–5pm · {{ site.address.street }}, {{ site.address.city }}, {{ site.address.state }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
